<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Laboratory Corp said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Laboratory Corp said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Laboratory Corp of America to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- After Thursday's close, Laboratory Corp reported a third quarter loss of $1.19 per share after unusual expenses and restructuring charges.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 3-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
